    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Donghdongh danghdangh, hwnj dangz lo. \"",
        "zh": "叮叮当当”，上课了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Yox, ndaek vunz mwngz naengh l umj you nei ha wj gou dungxcieg li ux.",
        "zh": "哟，你这个人坐着像石像一样一声不吭，吓了我一跳。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De dwg dahcej mwngz lwi?",
        "zh": "她是你姐姐吗？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz roxnaj dahnuengx de ha?",
        "zh": "你认识他妹妹吗？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Hawj gou nw?",
        "zh": "是给我的吗？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz caeuq raeuz bae la?",
        "zh": "你跟我们去吗？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De vunz laeng raeuz?",
        "zh": "他是我们那儿的人？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz bae guh seng'eiq?",
        "zh": "你去做生意？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz mbouj bae?",
        "zh": "你不去？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Daxgoeng de lij da raeh?",
        "zh": "他爷爷的眼睛还好？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Byawz ngoenzlwenz daeuj laeng gou yawj saw lo?",
        "zh": "谁昨天到我家看书了？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De seizlawz daeuj laeng gou yawj saw lo?",
        "zh": "他什么时候到家我看书了？",
