        "zh": "你吃米饭还是吃面条？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou rap haeuxraeh roxnaeuz rap haeuxsan?",
        "zh": "我挑稻谷还是大米？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou raemj roxnaeuz mwngz raemj?",
